+
+## Bulk import
+
+`importTasks(list, text)` adds tasks from text, one per line as `title;priority;tags`, for example
+`Renew the insurance;high;admin money`. The priority may be empty (a normal task) and the tags are
+separated by spaces. Blank lines are skipped. It returns `{ imported, rejected }`, where `rejected` lists
+each line that could not be added as `{ line, reason }`, with `line` counting from 1 over all lines.
